{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:31:53.699661686Z","verse":15,"ref":"leviticus 7:15","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":7,"translation":"And the flesh of the sacrifice of thanksgiving of his peace offerings shall be eaten on the day of his offering; he shall not leave any of it until morning.","tokens":[{"surface":"ובשר","gloss":"and the flesh"},{"surface":"זבח","gloss":"of the sacrifice"},{"surface":"תודת","gloss":"of thanksgiving"},{"surface":"שלמיו","gloss":"of his peace-offerings"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"on the day"},{"surface":"קרבנו","gloss":"of his offering"},{"surface":"יאכל","gloss":"shall be eaten"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יניח","gloss":"he shall leave"},{"surface":"ממנו","gloss":"of it"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"until"},{"surface":"בקר","gloss":"morning"}]}